=Surveyor=
* Cost: %Minerals%10
* [[concepts/initiative|Initiative]]: 100
* [[concepts/weight|Weight]]: 1
* [[concepts/sensory|Base scanning range]]: 4
* Detects natural resources
This turret type detects all naturally occuring resources within its scanning range. It can be automated.
